{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zoo Wars</strong> is a real-time competitive tower defense game where cute animals and fruits clash in chaotic battles. The rules are simple: use your 6 cards of animals and fruits, and defeat your opponent\u2019s zoo first to claim victory! Smart deck-building and quick decision-making will decide the winner.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2-Player Online PvP</strong><br>Battle friends in private matches or challenge players worldwide in ranked matches.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique and Adorable Animals</strong><br>Mice, rabbits, monkeys, elephants, giraffes, and more \u2014 each with their own cute looks and unique abilities.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game-Changing Fruit Cards</strong><br>Strike with pinpoint attacks using apples, wipe out ground units with melons, or blast away the enemy zoo with watermelons \u2014 experience the thrill of powerful effects.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls \u00d7 Deep Strategy</strong><br>No complicated operations required. Easy to pick up for anyone, yet packed with strategic depth in deck-building and tactical mind games.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cross-Platform Play</strong><br>Play seamlessly between Steam and mobile, and enjoy battles anytime, anywhere.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3989360?t=1758959474","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3989360?t=1758959474","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989360/ee22b1f8c810b19a11176fe01458a5783e2ebcc2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758959474","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as